    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1809">

                <pb facs="1181" n="1065" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg1065"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 823.00/164.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister McMillin to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Extract.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Lima</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-05-15">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 15, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Congress met this afternoon with but little disturbance. Benavides was escorted
                    to Congress and sworn in as Provisional President.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">McMillin</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
